  "intro": [
    {
      "title": "How much, how many, and words that stand for a thing",
      "title_cz": "Kolik, jak moc a slova, která zastupují věc",
      "body": "There is no picture here, because none of these words names a thing you could draw.\nSome of them say how much or how many: some, any, no, many, a lot of, both, all. The others stand in place of a thing or a person you do not name: something, someone, everything, everybody."
    },
    {
      "title": "You will use these words in",
      "title_cz": "Tato slova použijete ve větách",
