        "I have some water.",
        "I don't have any water.",
        "There is no milk.",
        "Everybody is here.",
        "I have a lot of work."
      ],
      "note": "Use some in a normal sentence: I have some water. Use any after not and in questions: I don't have any water. Have you got any water?",
      "note_cz": "Pozor: some v kladné větě, any po not a v otázce."
